# "When you play another land" is the special action of playing a land (CR 305.1), not a land entering: Bot1 plays
# Marsh Flats on turn 1, then City of Traitors on turn 3 (the Flats is the other land, played before it, so nothing
# triggers) and cracks the Flats, which puts a Swamp onto the battlefield - the City is not sacrificed.

[Bot1 Deck]
Marsh Flats
City of Traitors
Island x6
Swamp
Island x6

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x13

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Marsh Flats.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.City of Traitors.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Marsh Flats.Activate
Bot1.Search(Swamp)
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = City of Traitors; Swamp
Bot1.Graveyard = Marsh Flats
Bot1.Life = 19
